ifications to support them.	https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608070/header.jpg?t=1727791468	2026-02-22 20:45:32.352587	CRISIS CORE –FINAL FANTASY VII– REUNION	CRISIS CORE -FINAL FANTASY VII- REUNION is a remaster of CRISIS CORE featuring updated graphics, combat systems and soundtrack. Follow the tale of SOLDIER operative Zack Fair, as he discovers the secrets of Shinra's dark experiments.	51
