r>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Master Your Moves</strong> - Master Classic Sonics famous spin-dash attack and utilise Modern Sonic’s ‘Boost’ as you complete all new tracks.</li></ul><br><strong>Casino Night DLC:</strong><br><br>Play through the iconic ‘Casino Night’ Pinball stage inspired by ‘Sonic The Hedgehog 2’	https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/71340/header.jpg?t=1762752644	2026-02-22 20:52:15.637564	Sonic Generations Collection	Celebrate 20 years of Sonic in an all new adventure that delivers a definitive experience to Sonic fans new and old!	49
