t by Max LL</li></ul>	https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323580/header.jpg?t=1752500989	2026-02-22 20:52:15.640144	Jotun: Valhalla Edition	Jotun is a hand-drawn action-exploration game set in Norse mythology. In Jotun, you play Thora, a Viking warrior who died an inglorious death and must prove herself to the Gods to enter Valhalla. Impress the Gods!	36
