263	837470	https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/837470/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1699052664	https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/837470/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1699052664	f	23 Sep, 2020	It's a lovely morning in the village and you are a horrible goose.<br><br>Untitled Goose Game is a slapstick-stealth-sandbox, where you are a goose let loose on an unsuspecting village. Make your way around town, from peoples' back gardens to the high street shops to the village green, setting up pranks, stealing hats, honking a lot, and generally ruining everyone’s day.<h2 class="bb_tag" >Featuring:</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li>A horrible goose (that's you)<br></li><li>A town full of people just trying to get on with their day (you hate them)<br></li><li>A dedicated honk button (!!!)</li></ul><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/837470/extras/e37ca532ba4e0a0cd90e5ea400651310.avif?t=1699052664" width=600 height=137 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >AND ALSO</h2>Oh dear! Two horrible geese!<br><br>You can now enjoy Untitled Goose Game with a friend, in a new two-player cooperative mode. Play through the whole game as two horrible geese, honking twice as much, teaming up to plan pranks, and generally ruining everyone's day, together.<br><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>A free update for all owners of Untitled Goose Game<br></li><li>Play through the entire game with two players<br></li><li>New goose, new honk, still horrible</li></ul><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/837470/extras/aa4dae1489826ae6ae717d011d2620df.avif?t=1699052664" width=600 height=360 /></span>	https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/837470/header.jpg?t=1699052664	2026-02-22 20:52:15.644783	Untitled Goose Game	It's a lovely morning in the village and you are a horrible goose.	25
264	204360	https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764096331	https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764096331	f	26 Sep, 2012	<p class="bb_paragraph" >Hack, slash, and smash your way to victory in this 2D sidescrolling arcade adventure from The Behemoth! Play with up to four friends locally or online to defend the kingdom, save the princesses, and crash some castles! </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/118ea5bc2e26afb7d7557a7de741283d.poster.avif?t=1764096331" width=800 height=312 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/118ea5bc2e26afb7d7557a7de741283d.webm?t=1764096331" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/118ea5bc2e26afb7d7557a7de741283d.mp4?t=1764096331" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Key Features</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Unlock more than 25 characters and over 40 different weapons!</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Level up your character with skill points and adjust Strength, Magic, Defense, and Agility to your liking.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Intuitive magic and combo system: unlock an arsenal of new attacks as your character progresses through the game.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/c7a65d7999cf08a4b2484436aee6f16a.poster.avif?t=1764096331" width=800 height=626 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/c7a65d7999cf08a4b2484436aee6f16a.webm?t=1764096331" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/c7a65d7999cf08a4b2484436aee6f16a.mp4?t=1764096331" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Local or online co-op gameplay: pick up and continue the adventure with your friends at the drop of a helmet!</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Collect adorable animal orbs for your companions, each with different abilities to aid you on your journey.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/bf758fb6ab4392e02e1b3a4a90e7df0b.poster.avif?t=1764096331" width=800 height=532 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/bf758fb6ab4392e02e1b3a4a90e7df0b.webm?t=1764096331" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/bf758fb6ab4392e02e1b3a4a90e7df0b.mp4?t=1764096331" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Game Modes</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Arena: battle other players in team matches or free-for-all!</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Insane Mode: test your skills in the ULTIMATE campaign challenge!</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Back Off Barbarian: jump and hop across the level to avoid the enemies in this minigame!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/d212294f97bec78e3cd109cf6f30ce2d.poster.avif?t=1764096331" width=800 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/d212294f97bec78e3cd109cf6f30ce2d.webm?t=1764096331" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/extras/d212294f97bec78e3cd109cf6f30ce2d.mp4?t=1764096331" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >DLC</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Enhance the standard gameplay experience with the Blacksmith and Pink Knight character packs, or unlock Paint Junior and custom character capabilities with the new Painter Boss Paradise DLC!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The Painter Boss Paradise DLC also includes:</p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >A custom character template </p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >New art for all official playable characters and weapons!</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >New map art for fancier adventuring!</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Endless knightly possibilities - choose from community characters or preloaded characters created by our team!</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Worried about buying the DLC and missing the nostalgic feel of the original art? Have no fear, as you can toggle the Painter Boss Paradise DLC’s functionality on or off from the main menu at any time to experience the classic adventure! Check out the DLC store page linked above to learn more!</p>	https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/204360/header.jpg?t=1764096331	2026-02-22 20:52:15.644783	Castle Crashers®	Hack, slash, and smash your way to victory in this award winning 2D arcade adventure from The Behemoth!	12
